        "itemOffered": {
          "@type": "LodgingBusiness",
          "description": "Discover the endless charms of Fremantle with a stylish stay at the Esplanade Hotel Fremantle by Rydges, a gorgeous heritage hotel dating back to 1850. Between exploring the gems of Fremantle's fun-filled streets, make use of the hotel's exceptional facilities: take a dip in one of the two swimming pools and soak in the Western Australian sunshine, be wined and dined in the Atrium Garden Restaurant or treat yourself to a classic pub feast and drink at Ball & Chain pub, featuring a sleek bourbon lounge. Just 30 minutes from Perth, this iconic property places you just moments away from fabulous food, a thriving craft beer scene, great restaurants and trendy boutiques, making it the perfect destination for a memorable escape.",
          "image": "https://images.luxuryescapes.com/gb7x5d2d3w2hnujught",
